  "description": "Dead",
  "content": "<div><br></div><div><div><div><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-73cc4efc-7fff-2345-bf45-90312cc6da60\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><br><br></font><h1 style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font color=\"#ffffff\">Dead (newest on top) :</font></span></h1></span></div><p><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></p><h2 id=\"azaelith-draconis\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Azaelith Draconis</h2><p>kobold rogue, Aiden -- DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/azaelith aiden1.png\" data-filename=\"azaelith aiden1.png\" data-size=\"1091371\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 352px; height: auto;\" data-flagged=\"true\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"narrak's-ettin-bodyguard\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Narrak's Ettin bodyguard</h2><p>at Whorlstone Tunnels beneath Grackstugh city — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Ettin Token.png\" data-filename=\"Ettin Token.png\" data-size=\"262518\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 343px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"narrak\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Narrak</h2><p>derro cult leader of Demogorgon, at Whorlstone Tunnels beneath Grackstugh city — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Narrak derro.png\" data-filename=\"Narrak derro.png\" data-size=\"745953\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 345px; height: auto;\" data-flagged=\"true\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"pincushion\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Pincushion</h2><p>living doll, mean toy at Loomlurch — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/living doll.png\" data-filename=\"living doll.png\" data-size=\"2724799\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 350px; height: auto;\" data-flagged=\"true\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"cryo-bot\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Cryo-bot</h2><p>toy construct at Loomlurch, killed by Perry's bare hands — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Cryo-bot- scenery Feywild thither Skabatha Toys Constructs Servos .jpg\" data-filename=\"Cryo-bot- scenery Feywild thither Skabatha Toys Constructs Servos .jpg\" data-size=\"139840\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 347px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"zarak\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Zarak</h2><p>gnome assassin from Wayward pool, member of Kelek's League of Malevolence — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Zarak assassin gnome goblin unseelie fey league malevolence.jpg\" data-filename=\"Zarak assassin gnome goblin unseelie fey league malevolence.jpg\" data-size=\"165991\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 350px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"poison-knights\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Poison Knights</h2><p>Kelek Unseelie Knight constructs with Zarak — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/monsters forest fey unseelie knight light brian-valeza-ada.jpg\" data-filename=\"monsters forest fey unseelie knight light brian-valeza-ada.jpg\" data-size=\"273622\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 350px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"lamorna-the-unicorn\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Lamorna the Unicorn</h2><p>ghost from Wayward Pool — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Lamorna unicorn.jpg\" data-filename=\"Lamorna unicorn.jpg\" data-size=\"217036\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 347px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"nib's-haunts\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Nib's haunts</h2><p>ghosts from Nib's past — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/nibs 1 cave ghost haunt blind miser.png\" data-filename=\"nibs 1 cave ghost haunt blind miser.png\" data-size=\"1761106\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 357px; height: auto;\" data-flagged=\"true\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"knight-light-revenant\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Knight Light Revenant</h2><p>boss construct that attacked outside Nib's in Thither — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/knight light jack o lantern pumpkin reaper scythe unseelie fey.jpg\" data-filename=\"knight light jack o lantern pumpkin reaper scythe unseelie fey.jpg\" data-size=\"172770\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 350px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"knight-lights\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Knight Lights</h2><p>constructs that attacked outside Nib's in Thither — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/candle knight light unseelie fey.jpg\" data-filename=\"candle knight light unseelie fey.jpg\" data-size=\"53782\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 356px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"king-gullop-xix-and-the-soggy-court\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">King Gullop XIX and the Soggy Court</h2><p>bullywug nobles — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/King Gullop XIX -Snoodle baby crocodile-wild-beyond-witchlight.png\" data-filename=\"King Gullop XIX -Snoodle baby crocodile-wild-beyond-witchlight.png\" data-size=\"819338\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 413px; height: auto;\" data-flagged=\"true\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"hemeth\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Hemeth</h2><p>Duergar/gray dwarf prisoner from Sloobludop, killed by Morg in fight at the Inn at the End of the Road against Bav's taxidermy constructs — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Dwarf Duergar Gray male Hemeth Sloobludop Dwarf Duergar Gray male cf17a8d4f5e250d6f48211efb5ac3ce3.jpg\" data-filename=\"Dwarf Duergar Gray male Hemeth Sloobludop Dwarf Duergar Gray male cf17a8d4f5e250d6f48211efb5ac3ce3.jpg\" data-size=\"153854\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 354px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"morgort-the-knight-of-warts\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Morgort the Knight of Warts</h2><p>female bullywug friend of Talavar and Wigglewog, killed by Bav and made into taxidermy construct at the Inn at the End of the Road — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/fey bullywug Morgort knight warts.jpg\" data-filename=\"fey bullywug Morgort knight warts.jpg\" data-size=\"101337\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 351px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"sir-talavar\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Sir Talavar</h2><p>fairy dragon, killed by Bav and made into taxidermy construct at the Inn at the End of the Road — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Sir Talavar violet faerie fairy dragon .jpg\" data-filename=\"Sir Talavar violet faerie fairy dragon .jpg\" data-size=\"103393\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 352px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"&quot;glug&quot;-glooglugogg\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">\"Glug\" Glooglugogg</h2><p>son of \"Papa\" Archpriest Ploo of Sloobludop, killed by Morg in fight at the Inn at the End of the Road against Bav's taxidermy constructs — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Glooglugogg glug sloobludop Kuo-toa 5cfa0fa3ef60e496edb9ea28c80bbd0a.jpg\" data-filename=\"Glooglugogg glug sloobludop Kuo-toa 5cfa0fa3ef60e496edb9ea28c80bbd0a.jpg\" data-size=\"193926\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 346px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"'ploo'-ploopploopeen\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">'Ploo' Ploopploopeen</h2><p>Kuo-toa Archpriest of the Sea Mother, \"Papa Archpriest\", killed by Demogorgon — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Ploopploopeen sloobludop kuo toa archpriest.jpg\" data-filename=\"Ploopploopeen sloobludop kuo toa archpriest.jpg\" data-size=\"48702\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 348px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"'klib'\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">'Klib'</h2><p>Kuo-toa keeper of the altar of the Deep Father, \"Ax\", killed by Jibjib almost exclusively sniping Eldritch Blasts — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Klibdoloogut sloobludop Kuo-toa 156a216c7dc441fe708845782432388e.jpg\" data-filename=\"Klibdoloogut sloobludop Kuo-toa 156a216c7dc441fe708845782432388e.jpg\" data-size=\"76143\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 356px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"'blopp'-bloppblippodd\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">'Blopp' Bloppblippodd</h2><p>Archpriestess of Deep Father / Demogorgon, Daughter of Ploo, at Sloobludop, killed by Party in battle at Sloobludop — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Bloppblippodd kuo toa archpriest sloobludop.jpg\" data-filename=\"Bloppblippodd kuo toa archpriest sloobludop.jpg\" data-size=\"56041\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 346px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"unnamed-kuo-toa-cultist-shopkeeper\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Unnamed Kuo-toa cultist shopkeeper</h2><p>at Bubbles &amp; Barbs, died when Demogorgon destroyed Sloobludop — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Kuo-toa c18a83f6054e4b0d71388ab3fdba06d0.jpg\" data-filename=\"Kuo-toa c18a83f6054e4b0d71388ab3fdba06d0.jpg\" data-size=\"82099\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 347px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"unnamed-kuo-toa-fisherman\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Unnamed Kuo-toa fisherman</h2><p>died when Demogorgon destroyed Sloobludop — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Kuo-toa mauro-belfiore-15012019.jpg\" data-filename=\"Kuo-toa mauro-belfiore-15012019.jpg\" data-size=\"43364\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 339px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"unnamed-kuo-toa-shopkeep\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Unnamed Kuo-toa shopkeep</h2><p>at the Silted Soul, died when Demogorgon destroyed Sloobludop — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Kuo-toa 3a7934e38875ab920064842e28a4d7f6.jpg\" data-filename=\"Kuo-toa 3a7934e38875ab920064842e28a4d7f6.jpg\" data-size=\"83652\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 346px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"unnamed-kuo-toa-guard\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Unnamed Kuo-toa Guard</h2><p>died when Demogorgon destroyed Sloobludop — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Kuo-toa fb3f7f6a16c4527365f4de26824bbeed.jpg\" data-filename=\"Kuo-toa fb3f7f6a16c4527365f4de26824bbeed.jpg\" data-size=\"67833\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 345px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"unnamed-kuo-toa-fisherman-#2\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Unnamed Kuo-toa fisherman</h2><p>DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Kuo-toa 1a37b7f99bb1c3b66d02cf1948b4d6de.jpg\" data-filename=\"Kuo-toa 1a37b7f99bb1c3b66d02cf1948b4d6de.jpg\" data-size=\"42045\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 348px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"gnoll-shaman/fang\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Gnoll Shaman/Fang</h2><p>DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://cdnb.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/043/821/789/medium/clark-ocleasa-f.jpg?1638351005\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 348px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"gnoll-brute\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Gnoll Brute</h2><p>DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/monsters gnoll male art-of-nate-gnoll-to-post.jpg\" data-filename=\"monsters gnoll male art-of-nate-gnoll-to-post.jpg\" data-size=\"311897\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 350px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"gnoll-hunters\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Gnoll Hunters</h2><p>DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/monsters gnoll male b78e4c446f3f85ce48e2ebf5e92dd79a.jpg\" data-filename=\"monsters gnoll male b78e4c446f3f85ce48e2ebf5e92dd79a.jpg\" data-size=\"62150\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 346px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"gnoll-havoc-runner\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Gnoll Havoc Runner</h2><p>DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/monsters gnoll male 56493c7ffd153ba34350c465238051ca.jpg\" data-filename=\"monsters gnoll male 56493c7ffd153ba34350c465238051ca.jpg\" data-size=\"48188\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 350px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"gnoll-witherlings\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Gnoll Witherlings</h2><p>undead — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/monsters gnoll male uros-sljivic-doombringer-festering-mongrel-final.jpg\" data-filename=\"monsters gnoll male uros-sljivic-doombringer-festering-mongrel-final.jpg\" data-size=\"420199\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 359px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"nira-nestfoot\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Nira Nestfoot</h2><p>halfling cleric from Bav's Cottage, killed by lightning magic in Lost Tunnels Puzzle — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Niranaalith Nira Nestfoot halfling fem.jpg\" data-filename=\"Niranaalith Nira Nestfoot halfling fem.jpg\" data-size=\"501834\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 354px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"charm\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Charm</h2><p>darkling 'merchant', killed by drow and quaggoths in Velkynvelve — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Charm-Darkling-Elder-Trinket-Bauble-wild-beyond-witchlight.png\" data-filename=\"Charm-Darkling-Elder-Trinket-Bauble-wild-beyond-witchlight.png\" data-size=\"1139998\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 373px; height: auto;\" data-flagged=\"true\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"prince-darendil\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Prince Derendil</h2><p>quaggoth, uppity, rages, killed by Ilvara's Insect Plague spiders in Ilvara's Quarters — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Derendil Quaggoth.png\" data-filename=\"Derendil Quaggoth.png\" data-size=\"351261\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 347px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"shaiir-vandree\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Shaiir Vandree</h2><p>drow, Ilvara's lieutenant and 2nd in command, killed by Party — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Shaiir Vandree drow male b98a4ff09beafd36a8347d1dae8f67ad.jpg\" data-filename=\"Shaiir Vandree drow male b98a4ff09beafd36a8347d1dae8f67ad.jpg\" data-size=\"110602\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 350px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"drow-priestess\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Drow priestess</h2><p>killed fighting Party, finished off as collateral damage by Ilvara — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Asha Vandree drow priestess.jpg\" data-filename=\"Asha Vandree drow priestess.jpg\" data-size=\"48970\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 346px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"jorlan-duskryn\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Jorlan Duskryn</h2><p>scarred drow, came by the cell and offered a chance to escape, lured demons to Velkynvelve — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Jorlan Duskryn drow.png\" data-filename=\"Jorlan Duskryn drow.png\" data-size=\"1236848\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 350px; height: auto;\" data-flagged=\"true\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"a-darkmantle\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">A darkmantle</h2><p>from Bav's Cottage — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Darkmantle Token.png\" data-filename=\"Darkmantle Token.png\" data-size=\"223646\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 342px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"zargash's-bodyguard\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Zargash's bodyguard</h2><p>Mushroom Knight killed by Daterra's Moonbeam — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/knight cap unseelie fey.jpg\" data-filename=\"knight cap unseelie fey.jpg\" data-size=\"86279\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 342px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"zargash-the-satyr\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Zargash the satyr</h2><p>killed Harabax, sought missing unicorn horn, killed by Daterra's Moonbeam — DEAD</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jt1919191919/dnd-tool/main/data/images/Zargash priest Orcus satyr faun unseelie fey league malevolence.jpg\" data-filename=\"Zargash priest Orcus satyr faun unseelie fey league malevolence.jpg\" data-size=\"47209\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px; width: 349px; height: auto;\" draggable=\"false\"></p><p><br></p><hr><h2 id=\"madam-styria-harabax\" style=\"color: rgb(211, 154, 57);\">Madam Styria Harabax</h2><p>human druid innkee